#: scenario7:scenario7_C08979FC_22A9_4FC0_A2AC_D72F1C7BD275
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 571f6cce104b8c13ece45e5ae3d2c5ea007fb4e79f095a784ea1da23a96e767e
#. default-sha256: 3cfde6915089a26bde1a91b9621751834f311ee4cf3b74fd8352718ca38d2489
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C08979FC_22A9_4FC0_A2AC_D72F1C7BD275"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’re too shortsighted, Didier.⟪k:2⟫You need to look at the big picture.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Sometimes, it’s the tactician and not the soldier holding the sword."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você tem uma visão muito limitada, Didier.⟪k:2⟫Precisa olhar para o quadro geral.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫Às vezes, é o estrategista e não o soldado que segura a espada."

