"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Haha, that I am. ⟪k:2⟫War ⟪k:3⟫is⟪k:4⟫ the men’s job, after all.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"I want you to be there to welcome me home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Haha, isso eu vou. ⟪k:2⟫Guerra ⟪k:3⟫é⟪k:4⟫ trabalho dos homens, afinal.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Você—"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Eu quero que você esteja lá para me receber em casa."

