"do we have here?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Acabei de voltar, aham.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ohoho, jogando xadrez de novo, né?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Vamos ver, "
"o que temos aqui?"

