msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Still, you need to be careful.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You can’t spend too much time in "
"the sun."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ainda assim, você precisa ter cuidado.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Não pode passar muito "
"tempo no sol."

