msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Eu tinha dois irmãos mais velhos."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F6FD7D33_A16B_4BEE_9AA7_52A0128B576F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40275289a18bd3928b6f219f996776e26491a927845e0decf52d50b8f75bccbc
