msgid "⟪k:0⟫And below him was Georges, who served as a court artist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E abaixo dele estava Georges, que servia como artista da corte."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2FAD12A_1A86_4F8D_9661_1A24D8113827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e6d88aae224321715e93f3bc9f3c6ecd0680a991df23a9cb370d078a9b22f20
