msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2FAD12A_1A86_4F8D_9661_1A24D8113827"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was, in all likelihood, who would inherit the family estate,⟪k:1⟫as knights were not "
"formally allowed to own property."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele era, com toda a probabilidade, quem herdaria a propriedade da família,⟪k:1⟫já que "
"cavaleiros não eram autorizados a possuir propriedade formalmente."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7B2E246B_09D9_4CC7_BC27_FC94313AEFE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a572acc8bccd71d04b489b5ab746a33f66b5c69d0965488b17f1a9d457dfd5f4
