msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6C9D1053_1A98_4762_893E_69AFE856DEBF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Physically, I was not in particularly good health.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Because of the color of my skin, "
"I was hypersensitive to sunlight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fisicamente, eu não estava particularmente bem de saúde.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por causa da cor da minha "
"pele, eu era hipersensível à luz do sol."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4380A140_94F1_4C41_8683_C53498013BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 409438e15897a53d5c065b48ed83ef8c8a74017992bf9f54197de9c331480005
#. default-sha256: 2a508b4e7e658e7567fbd03e1613c4e5c4a7805b4e6947490de867a3f8a90a94
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4380A140_94F1_4C41_8683_C53498013BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I rarely left the estate. ⟪k:1⟫My world was contained entirely within these walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu raramente deixava a propriedade. ⟪k:1⟫Meu mundo estava contido inteiramente dentro dessas "
"paredes."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2044A04C_BCA6_41A9_8A50_912DB7080785
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 936d3b2922ec30b525d69dfc41871c4dea9d028ae114ecb4799f22b3b0ae6bf3
