msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2044A04C_BCA6_41A9_8A50_912DB7080785"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And perhaps out of some sense of pity or compassion,⟪k:1⟫my two brothers spent a good deal "
"of time with me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E talvez por algum sentimento de pena ou compaixão,⟪k:1⟫meus dois irmãos passavam muito "
"tempo comigo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A2D05211_ACC3_49DB_89DB_EEDF7A9D8979
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a115c9d4d518d41fdf5a2ba413fbf665272978b417b54fa6f89256100b3ef77e
