msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_638139D8_135C_4AAA_86B3_F046485B7999"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And among other things, they taught me how to read and write.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For a girl, I was "
"incredibly fortunate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E entre outras coisas, eles me ensinaram a ler e escrever.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Para uma garota, eu era "
"incrivelmente afortunada."

#: scenario7:scenario7_211612B5_6D74_41B6_B14A_6FEC23EE533C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d84f07f051e1189aa10458ca660ac9fd6af866f21dfa72ee4b1662524238c26
#. default-sha256: 0e57af78338536a02d728c71beae577a183bea23058dbc94ec91d2e1c727004d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_211612B5_6D74_41B6_B14A_6FEC23EE533C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The one thing I wasn’t allowed to do, though, was hold a sword."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A única coisa que eu não tinha permissão para fazer, porém, era segurar uma espada."

#: scenario7:scenario7_22C434B2_4CF3_4B38_B305_E352B14E7470
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
