msgid "⟪k:0⟫And it had for as long as I could remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E assim o era desde que eu conseguia me lembrar."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DFBBA795_374C_4B95_A3D4_D000C829AE2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 039f9a1f885f0d5481acc98b703a2826dfe4bc691810e300bab84ce35ef5ce6c
