msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No jardim, meus dois irmãos trocavam golpes com o peito nu."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AADA5C9C_F2E7_417E_830E_20644F5D2D60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01506299abb745449c44b8b11f4246735f2339b0888072a42a847a8cad2fcdfe
