msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I could do, though, was observe from afar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tudo o que podia fazer, porém, era observar de longe."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA651833_C1E3_404A_BC2A_9A5E412B6C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
