msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And every time I found myself forced to watch,⟪k:1⟫I felt a sharp pain, like a needle "
"piercing my chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E toda vez que me via forçada a assistir,⟪k:1⟫Sentia uma dor aguda, como uma agulha "
"perfurando meu peito."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9120BFCD_4DD0_41F9_A80B_E4EBD5CB9F29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
