"dizia o quanto me amava,⟪k:3⟫e suas dissertações sobre como era maravilhoso ser uma garota."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3F59DDA7_CF9A_4DF9_BE02_B92DA1FF2467
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5366d460075178f496063692175d73da49cbc1fc67902a70b8381527998c011e
#. default-sha256: 84845d02935afc5681dd84b70b12ce480cfbbff0526a2a6083628076a6557e18
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3F59DDA7_CF9A_4DF9_BE02_B92DA1FF2467"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything she did put so much pressure on me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tudo o que ela fazia colocava tanta pressão sobre mim."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CE2E1D09_66F6_435B_A47D_178C1499ECE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62e75219089af047965ea0243668467ea076f0b9ae43aef7a59ccef36107baf0
#. default-sha256: 0550b10bf6fe08ea1672c8c521b01b2c93fe8aee61be4de30503263ea801c6ca
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CE2E1D09_66F6_435B_A47D_178C1499ECE6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But above all, she loved to say,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas acima de tudo, ela adorava dizer,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_40CC3113_166E_4F46_AB19_9B65026E3104
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 643ac247cf0366af06e78e1076e5586d39c9c697691b5af67c51941886cca287
#. default-sha256: 7a7f75504986bdff69fc38fe90237c03faaf0892fb8744bc2d735c01c605673b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_40CC3113_166E_4F46_AB19_9B65026E3104"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“You are my little girl, after all.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫“Você é minha garotinha, afinal.”"

#: scenario7:scenario7_97EE9F1F_BDCD_4642_A558_613823B6A2B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 967fd4398f11e85227003592dfcc41e150fac66933b503a5baafdc1da4a947b4
#. default-sha256: 770a591e7e9db5979a61225d34074c553039ec38dd09116c8a8375219e7aba60
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_97EE9F1F_BDCD_4642_A558_613823B6A2B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And there was nothing strange about that at all.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Every time I looked in the mirror, "
"I saw the daughter of a noble."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E não havia nada de estranho nisso.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Toda vez que me olhava no espelho, via a filha "
"de um nobre."

#: scenario7:scenario7_17CA319E_29B8_4BAC_9174_34D54AC6B73E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4f24758e0d510d486e8bc0b317a2703a75426d498e4560c82a354d67ee91b34
#. default-sha256: 3933d755ca8d4bff609ad7ac0732b71567a797be44ce54656951de2488098748
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17CA319E_29B8_4BAC_9174_34D54AC6B73E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was who I was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Isso era quem eu era."

#: scenario7:scenario7_31BB60FB_F04C_4B7A_B20C_B8B6D53E67B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ffe83166b23e9e79a12805379323f9a083a65069e517b719fa0dbc07207139ff
#. default-sha256: b6dd77b479efa7ab0a97c9ab349373e701de8b9e1005e6c27f6f302b6b6887bf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_31BB60FB_F04C_4B7A_B20C_B8B6D53E67B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So the only thing wrong was how I felt.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But every time I was faced with the reality "
"of who I was,⟪k:3⟫my heart wavered."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Então a única coisa de errado era como eu me sentia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mas toda vez que me deparava "
"com a realidade de quem eu era,⟪k:3⟫meu coração vacilava."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7D390B35_CFEA_44BA_B2D3_9C4936A62744
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f58dfff00c9e3b19e209b1ddca8e76194e7adc8fd3e006fa056301e2e98e5da8
#. default-sha256: c881bc312dfb20081c99cb0a1203d7a8cd312ab5cf2f0595ef9c5f62759d3689
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7D390B35_CFEA_44BA_B2D3_9C4936A62744"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had no interest in learning to embroider.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t understand why that was "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não tinha interesse em aprender a bordar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu não entendia porque isso era "
"necessário."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4823A1AD_DAD4_4DB1_ACDD_B3E5A7978C42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6202fcfc829a6a3698821d8f1e81d1cded0f54974ee3102ddf1af496deae5604
#. default-sha256: 9d7a8167f47f755effe4470d9757dc0ce3e12dcfc72016b77531f7f5ae188a71
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4823A1AD_DAD4_4DB1_ACDD_B3E5A7978C42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew what ⟪k:1⟫purpose⟪k:2⟫ it served.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Everything she taught me I would need when "
"I was wed off to some noble boy, and it was my responsibility to learn those things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu sabia a que ⟪k:1⟫propósito⟪k:2⟫ servia.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tudo o que ela me ensinou eu precisaria "
"quando me casasse com algum garoto nobre, e era minha responsabilidade aprender essas coisas."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DD428462_CCB8_4425_9B29_625B4551C86B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f23d34ddcec5cff0ef6022ed8014eb5fc7b1efe3bfca5b3704cae30eca088fa2
#. default-sha256: 48202f4d4a065f1f4b6c59113754491bb600fbc894801c47d7a3b1b6a94b7829
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DD428462_CCB8_4425_9B29_625B4551C86B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It didn’t ⟪k:1⟫feel⟪k:2⟫ right, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não ⟪k:1⟫parecia⟪k:2⟫ certo, no entanto."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC99167B_038C_4D39_A0E4_1DCA328ED343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be12045e1e616e1b83fa0e5e6869592eb9dfc896691bc186788bb6eafa1e9849
#. default-sha256: eb2534c5b4454d13db8a6eb113346b0fbcc997d19b3f1c5d95f5fcb9153bca34
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DC99167B_038C_4D39_A0E4_1DCA328ED343"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t even accept the fact that, one day, I ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ be married.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was "
"but an ominous shadow lurking in my future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não conseguia nem aceitar o fato de que, um dia, eu ⟪k:1⟫deveria⟪k:2⟫ me casar.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Era apenas uma sombra sinistra à espreita no meu futuro."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4C590195_04A2_4FD1_A13E_98ACBEFC6E5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe0e59433d535f2211af1225699088bae245fc7181a99aefa3f3ae00bbc37c9c
#. default-sha256: 0749653b935f33f5886a0c69b0daaa01d3bb5b051e60623b70bf51c51d2eb4e8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4C590195_04A2_4FD1_A13E_98ACBEFC6E5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would have preferred ravaging the books in Didier’s room than having a conversation with "
"my mother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Teria preferido devorar os livros do quarto de Didier do que conversar com minha mãe."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B2AFDD9C_5C06_4F2B_ABD1_9D6682D27DF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f829a82461944d2e5d4be605c5286f03e391f032705d092e37d775100b250cd7
#. default-sha256: 3cf159574646498e1ecbbab256cac23bbfd68951862836620fac2e740e24db92
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B2AFDD9C_5C06_4F2B_ABD1_9D6682D27DF9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tales of heroes of old and dauntless soldiers. ⟪k:1⟫Military texts written by tacticians in "
"the midst of war."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Contos de heróis da antiguidade e soldados destemidos. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Textos militares escritos "
"por estrategistas em plena guerra."

#: scenario7:scenario7_02D63A4D_36B0_451F_BA0D_A97A383C2A42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92d05bd9b3a2904fcab09a92ed26fd676febe60adde68aa7ca7472d175566286
#. default-sha256: e5c4410d9a6a28fdbf6cad33f4758e8fac1d6ec4636e3fa38841068d9707212a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_02D63A4D_36B0_451F_BA0D_A97A383C2A42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Thinking about them set my heart aflutter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and made me think about my brother. ⟪k:3⟫"
"He was training to be a knight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pensar neles fez meu coração disparar—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e me fez pensar em meu irmão. ⟪k:3⟫Ele "
"estava treinando para ser um cavaleiro."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FB9D7E3E_A529_401F_AD7D_FB5D1B459759
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c86ed5f83ee78303ef5608c554fc2270f91edbacfaed713d5126770e53fa2351
