msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FB9D7E3E_A529_401F_AD7D_FB5D1B459759"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I envisioned armor flecked with rust.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A longsword glimmering with the blood of "
"savages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu imaginei uma armadura salpicada de ferrugem.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Uma espada longa brilhando com o "
"sangue de selvagens."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9CEA3EE3_8726_48B8_852E_D58FAF6208A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52481a56fa6b2ce6cb333846eec93fcc4d685f773ccf830b54b47386d7b44f31
#. default-sha256: 8c38b0fc2796555cd695e0ef633f19486f8acf2c3f8a5ee15eb86baf6ad7ba60
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9CEA3EE3_8726_48B8_852E_D58FAF6208A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Soon, I found myself in my fantasies,⟪k:1⟫imagining how the sword would feel in my hands."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Logo, me encontrei em minhas fantasias,⟪k:1⟫imaginando como seria a sensação da espada em "
"minhas mãos."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4D6C3525_8C8E_4717_9B51_FB0174D081E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee8c0e48bdac28b71a4843513e8360480f7ce00a7700e8719e3ddff201210899
