msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4D6C3525_8C8E_4717_9B51_FB0174D081E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sensation of the hilt beneath my fingers.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Swinging it gallantly—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫like "
"my brother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A sensação do cabo sob meus dedos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Brandindo ela galantemente—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫como meu "
"irmão."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1ECAFF1A_C8D6_47F4_8762_4CB80EC38154
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 064e447323deae3cfb2a630720bfc8ac0af4752c870337bc1ec027b273d29cf7
#. default-sha256: 976d9a89f9e55ec38641a2276d0c62ffb98e7a813d325c60b26a718f7820e896
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1ECAFF1A_C8D6_47F4_8762_4CB80EC38154"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How heavy was it?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How much muscle would I need to carry it?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫How much "
"impact would I feel in my hands when I struck something?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quão pesado era?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quanto músculo eu precisaria para carregá-la?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quanto "
"impacto eu sentiria em minhas mãos ao atingir algo?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BB693CB4_54E7_4048_868C_F6CFB4159481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a7b16f0ac3c66e7d6881f98b794f73b0d6fde4a23f143acf1dd3ef20cc777fd
#. default-sha256: e47636039a073b3163099eacf6d3d2c090d30277c0068ca6ef79e3e99187aa40
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BB693CB4_54E7_4048_868C_F6CFB4159481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How restricted would my vision be wearing a helmet?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How much did it weigh? How hot "
"was it inside?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quão restrita seria minha visão usando um capacete?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quanto pesava? Quão quente "
"seria lá dentro?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E13C4293_797F_4238_B34F_42B0A92CD7C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b89855fec35fbe28d2a2fcaedd338867751e635677f64165ef76c295bd2bc9f
