msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, sim, obrigado.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Uggggh, estou acabado..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B1273B75_9AC7_4A9A_8227_37D2C304326F
