msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’ve never known Dee to half-ass something once he gets started.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Which, I "
"guess, is what makes him knight material, but..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu nunca soube do Dee fazer algo meia-boca quando começa alguma coisa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫O que, "
"eu acho, é o que o faz ter vocação para ser cavaleiro, mas..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DA601657_1B98_4FCE_911A_DC4B78AF6E3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 418b1350d09de2845a478dbf85010b6906e005a9fe3348635cda33ac197186cd
#. default-sha256: 009f315bc685dcc4f7b2aca007abc99be9530caf8652629ca52c3a5d61308d18
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DA601657_1B98_4FCE_911A_DC4B78AF6E3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you opposed to him becoming a knight?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você se opõe a ele se tornar um cavaleiro?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6884C936_CC64_4E3F_A1CE_ACE6C596A08F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5de2458ddc9dae8d4dc158a809976f223bb99dfe866398083dba741dd2adb929
#. default-sha256: 813e8a321afe79819a7d073723eebf6c936c0d4d1911da17f964ae8ab14b91ed
